--------------------------- Changelog -----------------------------

1.0.a - UNRELEASED
Added - Campaign radial menu: hold a hotkey (B or either Ctrl key by default) on the campaign map to open a wheel of abilities at the mouse, move onto one and release the key to use it. The slice under the mouse lifts out of the ring and eases back when you move on. The main wheel has 5 slots by default (1 to 10) and starts with Scavenge, Sustained Burn, Emergency Burn, Transponder and Go Dark, clockwise from the top. Hold the left mouse button on a slot for half a second to give it another of your fleet's abilities, empty it, or make it a submenu with its own icon and colour. Rest the mouse on a submenu to open it, and on its Back section to return; submenus hold 5 abilities by default (1 to 9) plus Back and cannot contain another submenu. Abilities your fleet lacks or cannot use right now are greyed out, a cooling ability's sector fills from the outer edge inward until it is ready, and active ones pulse. Release in the center or outside the ring, or press Escape, to cancel
Note - Requires LunaLib. Change or clear the hotkeys under Hotkeys, and the slot counts under Wheel, in LunaLib's mod settings
Note - Your wheel layout is saved for every campaign. data/config/radial_menu.json only sets the starting abilities
